er. When the Japanese invaders subject the area to their rule and cut down the sorghum to make way for a road, the community rises up and resists as the sorghum grows anew."},{"language":"zh-CN","title":"红高粱","overview":"作为国内“第五代导演”领军人物张艺谋的导演处女作，影片是第一部获得柏林电影节金熊奖的亚洲电影。改编自莫言同名小说的本片承载了很多影迷对于这片黄土地的炙热情感，美工出身的张艺谋在其第一部电影作品中即表现出了对色彩运用的独到见解，红与黄两个基色在影片中交相辉映，艳丽的色彩对比形成了强烈的电影视觉语言，将黄土高坡上的野性展现出了无与伦比的美感，长在陕北的张艺谋用这种独特的映像风格表达了对家乡的热爱，影片从“我”的视角塑造出了一众性格豪迈的陕北普通百姓，通过这些敢爱、敢恨，不畏生死的鲜明人物展现出的是一个民族的蓬勃生命力，影片还捧红了第一代谋女郎巩俐，那时尚在电影学院研读的巩俐还略显青涩，真挚自然的演出格外惹人喜爱，本片就像一杯凝结着民族魂魄的烈酒，值得我们每位中华儿女浊酒一杯。","tagline":"妹妹你大胆的往前走！"}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ujK7lXjxD7s47y27wF0nfN2i6cI.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/4bjVA2NrkrdNPPpKUt7eR2P3xlf.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":42006,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"zh-CN","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ujK7lXjxD7s47y27wF0nfN2i6cI.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/ujK7lXjxD7s47y27wF0nfN2i6cI.jpg","language":"it","width":532,"height":798},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ujK7lXjxD7s47y27wF0nfN2i6cI.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/ujK7lXjxD7s47y27wF0nfN2i6cI.jpg","language":"it","width":532,"height":798}]},"en":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2CP2eazEBKJ3njm4HM63pMfs5tW.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/2CP2eazEBKJ3njm4HM63pMfs5tW.jpg","language":"en","width":531,"height":797},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2CP2eazEBKJ3njm4HM63pMfs5tW.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/2CP2eazEBKJ3njm4HM63pMfs5tW.jpg","language":"en","width":531,"height":797},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/bGs0NQukb2ydcK9saQ